== Usage ==
This template is used to indicate that a utaite's song, discography, or playlist list is outdated and incomplete.
=== Syntax ===
<pre>
{{Outdated|latest upload date|type|latest upload time}}
</pre>
=== Parameters ===
; date
: The date of the most recent upload (required).
; type
: The type of list being updated (optional). Can be either "discography" or "playlist". If left blank or any other value is used, it defaults to "song".
; time
: The time of the most recent upload (optional). Recognized format → HH:mm)
=== Examples ===

For a song list:

<pre>
{{Outdated|October 12, 2022}}
</pre>

;output<nowiki>:</nowiki>
:{{Outdated|October 12, 2022}}

For a discography list:

<pre>
{{Outdated|October 12, 2022|discography}}
</pre>

;output<nowiki>:</nowiki>
:{{Outdated|October 12, 2022|discography}}

For a playlist:

<pre>
{{Outdated|October 12, 2022|playlist}}
</pre>

;output<nowiki>:</nowiki>
:{{Outdated|October 12, 2022|playlist}}

With upload time:

<div style="font-family: monospace; background-color: #222222; padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #ddd; white-space: pre;"><nowiki>{{Outdated|</nowiki>{{CURRENTJSTSTRMONTH}} {{CURRENTJSTDAY}}, {{CURRENTJSTYEAR}}|playlist|{{#expr:{{CURRENTJSTHOUR}}+1}}:{{CURRENTMINUTE}}}}</div>

;output<nowiki>:</nowiki>
:{{Outdated|{{CURRENTJSTSTRMONTH}} {{CURRENTJSTDAY}}, {{CURRENTJSTYEAR}}|playlist|{{#expr:{{CURRENTJSTHOUR}}+1}}:{{CURRENTMINUTE}}}}

